WEBVTT

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:03.539
<b>Narrator:</b> 1

00:00:06.992 --> 00:00:11.239
<b>GPS:</b> In 100 feet, turn left. Turn left.

00:00:13.332 --> 00:00:15.952
<b>Lisa:</b> Don’t turn right! Turn left!

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.917
<b>Mel:</b> It’s right, I’m sure.

00:00:19.307 --> 00:00:20.937
<b>Lisa:</b> No, it isn’t.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.801
<b>Mel:</b> Yes, it is!

00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:24.508
<b>Lisa:</b> No, it isn’t!

00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:26.091
This is wrong!

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:30.463
<b>Narrator:</b> 2

00:00:33.229 --> 00:00:35.863
<b>Lisa:</b> I’m thirsty. Where’s the water?

00:00:36.378 --> 00:00:38.697
<b>Mel:</b> Sorry, it’s empty.

00:00:39.181 --> 00:00:40.078
<b>Lisa:</b> Empty?

00:00:40.523 --> 00:00:41.944
<b>Mel:</b> Yes, empty.

00:00:42.491 --> 00:00:45.788
I’m hungry. And Alfie’s hungry.

00:00:46.263 --> 00:00:48.096
Let’s stop at a café.

00:00:48.485 --> 00:00:50.435
<b>Lisa:</b> OK, good idea.

00:00:54.482 --> 00:00:55.077
<b>Narrator:</b> 3

00:01:01.305 --> 00:01:02.345
<b>Mel:</b> Brrrr…

00:01:02.943 --> 00:01:04.268
<b>Lisa:</b> What’s the matter?

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:05.789
<b>Mel:</b> I’m cold.

00:01:06.368 --> 00:01:08.048
Can you close your window?

00:01:08.604 --> 00:01:11.152
<b>Lisa:</b> I’m not cold! I’m hot!

00:01:11.723 --> 00:01:15.320
<b>Mel:</b> Well, I’m cold. And Alfie’s cold.

00:01:15.891 --> 00:01:16.549
<b>Lisa:</b> OK.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.499
<b>Mel:</b> And please don’t drive fast!

00:01:21.792 --> 00:01:23.725
It’s really dangerous.

00:01:24.194 --> 00:01:26.801
<b>Lisa:</b> It’s fine. Don’t worry!

00:01:27.869 --> 00:01:29.179
<b>Mel:</b> Be careful!

00:01:34.231 --> 00:01:34.945
<b>Narrator:</b> 4

00:01:37.811 --> 00:01:40.533
<b>Lisa:</b> It’s late. Let’s look for a hotel.

00:01:40.961 --> 00:01:43.331
<b>Mel:</b> Oh, let’s not stop now.

00:01:43.693 --> 00:01:45.515
<b>Lisa:</b> I’m tired and it’s dark.

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:47.890
And Alfie’s tired, too.

00:01:48.505 --> 00:01:49.757
<b>Mel:</b> OK, OK.

00:01:50.481 --> 00:01:52.950
Look for a hotel near here.

00:01:53.617 --> 00:01:56.556
<b>Lisa:</b> The Highland Hotel’s 20 miles from here.

00:01:57.159 --> 00:01:59.203
<b>Mel:</b> Fine. No problem.

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:00.772
Let’s go there.